# Bitcoin Cycle & Momentum Notes

## ROC Analysis

### BTC Monthly ROC(12)

#### 1. Historical ROC Bottoms

The monthly ROC(12) indicator has dropped below `-69` only three times in Bitcoin’s history, and each occurrence aligned with a local market bottom:

| Date          | ROC(12) Condition |
| ------------- | ----------------- |
| January 2015  | Below -69         |
| December 2018 | Below -69         |
| December 2022 | Below -69         |

A possible 4-year cyclical structure can be observed here, potentially connected to Bitcoin’s halving cycle.

If the same spacing continues:

```text
December 2022 + 4 years = December 2026
```

As of April 2026, monthly ROC(12) was approximately `-19`.

---

